color: rgb(255, 187, 0);\">방분하시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; text-wrap: wrap; text-align: center; line-height: 1.5;\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px; background-color: rgb(255, 187, 0); color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">구미보건소 문의: 054-480-5000</span></font></p></pre><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; padding-top: 0px; text-wrap: wrap; text-align: center; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; text-wrap-style: initial; text-align: center; line-height: 1.5;\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px; text-wrap-mode: wrap; background-color: rgb(140, 252, 203); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">※ 아름관A동과 B동 사이와 아름책마루 옆 공간에 K-Square  창업밸리 구축공사가 \n아래 기간동안 진행될 예정입니다. 공사기간 내 소음이 발생할 수 있음을 사전에 안내드립니다.\n공사기간: 2026. 1. 7.(수) ~ 3. 5.(목)</span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; padding-top: 0px; text-wrap: wrap; text-align: center; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></span></p><pre style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace; font-size: 12.25px; overflow: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; line-height: 1.625rem; word-break: keep-all;\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); text-wrap: wrap; text-align: center; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><font face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 228, 0); color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">※&nbsp;</span></font><font face=\"함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 228, 0); color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">오름관3동 기혼자실은 최소 운영가능 인원 미충족 시 </span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 14pt; background-color: rgb(255, 228, 0);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">해당 </span></span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 14pt; background-color: rgb(255, 228, 0);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">방학</span>에<span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\"> 미운영</span>될 수 있음을</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); text-wrap: wrap; text-align: center; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 14pt; background-color: rgb(255, 228, 0);\">사전 안내드립니다.(배정인원의 30%이하일 경우 미운영 예정)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); text-wrap: wrap; text-align: center; line-height: 1.5;\"><font face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 18.6667px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 228, 0); color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br></span></span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; text-wrap-style: initial; text-align: center; line-height: 1.5;\"><font color=\"#ffffff\" face=\"Batang, 바탕, serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px; text-wrap-mode: wrap; background-color: rgb(102, 232, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">※ 생활관 시설 상세 사이즈는 생활관 홈페이지-생활관안내를 반드시 참고\n※ 학사력 변경에 따라 2026학년도 1학기 <span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">개관기간(퇴사일) 변경 가능</span>\n※ 하계방학 <span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">푸름관3·4동 리모델링 공사 예정</span>으로 </span></font><span style=\"background-color: rgb(102, 232, 255); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; font-size: 18.6667px; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\">2026학년도 </span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 18.6667px; text-wrap-mode: wrap; font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(102, 232, 255); color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">1년 호실 미운영 예정</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; text-wrap-style: initial; text-align: center; line-height: 1.5;\"><font color=\"#ffffff\" face=\"Batang, 바탕, serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px; text-wrap-mode: wrap; background-color: rgb(102, 232, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">※ 2026학년도 1학기 <span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">글로벌생활관 착공 예정</span>으로 인해 <span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">소음 발생 예상\n(착공 위치: 푸름관4동과 글로벌관 사이 주차장)</span></span></font></p></pre><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; text-wrap: wrap; text-align: center; line-height: 1.5;\"><br></p><pre style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace; font-size: 14px; overflow: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; line-height: 1.625rem; word-break: keep-all;\"><p class=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 33.4pt; line-height: 1.5; text-indent: -33.4pt; text-align: center;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -1.7pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; background-color: rgb(255, 228, 0); color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">[호실 사전신청 시 참고사항]</span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 33.4pt; padding-top: 0px; line-height: 1.5; text-indent: -33.4pt; text-align: center;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -1.7pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 94, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(255, 228, 0); font-size: 14pt;\">※ 푸름관2동 생활관비 </span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(255, 228, 0); font-size: 14pt;\">납부자는 </span></span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 228, 0); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">A자리+ B자리</span> 또는 <span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">A자리+ 탑층</span></span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 228, 0); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 14pt;\"> 신청가능</span></span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 33.4pt; padding-top: 0px; line-height: 1.5; text-indent: -33.4pt; text-align: center;\"><br></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 33.4pt; padding-top: 0px; line-height: 1.5; text-indent: -33.4pt; text-align: center;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -1.7pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; background-color: rgb(140, 252, 203); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">[신청 시 참고사항]</span></span></span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 33.4pt; padding-top: 0px; line-height: 1.5; text-indent: -33.4pt; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-align: left; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"> </span><span style=\"text-indent: -44.5333px; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 14pt;\">※ </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">푸름관 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">동 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">A</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">자리</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">큰 옷장</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">큰 책상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">, 1</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">층 침대 사용자</span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 33.4pt; padding-top: 0px; line-height: 1.5; text-indent: -33.4pt; text-align: center;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -1.7pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 14pt;\">※ </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">푸름관 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">동 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">B</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">자리</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">작은 </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 18.6667px; text-indent: -44.5333px;\">옷장</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">작은 책상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">, 2</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">층 침대 사용자</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; text-align: center; line-height: 1.5;\"></p><div id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"9157\" style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"></div><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 33.4pt; padding-top: 0px; line-height: 1.5; text-indent: -33.4pt; text-align: center;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -1.7pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 14pt;\">※ </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">푸름관 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">동 탑층 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">층 침대</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">작은 </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 18.6667px; text-indent: -44.5333px;\">옷장</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">작은 책상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">낮은 천장</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">, 2</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">층 침대 사용자</span></p></pre><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; text-wrap: wrap; text-align: center; line-height: 1.5;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; padding-top: 0px; text-wrap: wrap; text-align: center; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></p><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace; font-size: 14px; padding: 10px; border-style: double; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(254, 137, 67); background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-wrap: wrap;\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Batang, 바탕, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">[대학원 신입생 신청방법]</span></span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-wrap: wrap;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif;\">가. 2026학년도 1학기 대학원 신입생(입학생)은 일반선발 신청기간 내 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-wrap: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif;\">    [붙임3] 입사신청서 및 입사서약서</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif;\">를 작성하여 </span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif;\">이메일 제출</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-wrap: wrap;\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Batang, 바탕, serif\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">    (kit_dorm1@kumoh.ac.kr)</span>\n나. 대학원 신입생은 <span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">일반선발 신청기간 내 이메일 제출 미신청 시</span> 추후 <span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">추가선발 신청기간 내 </span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-wrap: wrap;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">    통합 정보시스템에서 본인이 직접 신청 가능</span></span></p></div><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; text-wrap: wrap; text-align: center; line-height: 1.5;\"><br></p><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace; font-size: 14px; padding: 10px; border-style: double; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(254, 137, 67); background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199); line-height: 1.5;\"><p class=\"0\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; text-wrap: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">[결핵진단서 제출방법]</span>\n가. 제출기간: 2026. 2. 13.(금) 10:00 ~ 2. 20.(금) 18:00\n      ※ 사전 미제출 시 현장에서 서류 제출 가능, 미제출시 입실 불가</span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; text-wrap: wrap; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">나. 제출방법: </span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; text-wrap-mode: wrap; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">통합 정보시스템 내 제출</span></p></div><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; text-wrap: wrap; text-align: center; line-height: 1.5;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; padding-top: 0px; text-wrap: wrap; text-align: center; line-height: 1.5;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></span></span></p><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; padding: 10px; text-wrap: wrap; border-style: double; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(159, 211, 49); background-color: rgb(231, 253, 181); line-height: 1.5;\"><p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace; font-size: 14px; text-wrap: nowrap;\"><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Batang, 바탕, serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; text-wrap: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24pt;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">FAQ</span></span>\n\n</span></font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; text-wrap: nowrap; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; text-wrap: wrap;\">  Q. </span><font color=\"#212529\" face=\"SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, Liberation Mono, Courier New, monospace\"><span style=\"text-wrap: wrap; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">일반선발기간 내 신청 중 기혼자실이랑 장애인실이 신청 페이지에 왜 없나요?</span></font></span><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Batang, 바탕, serif\"><font color=\"#212529\" face=\"SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, Liberation Mono, Courier New, monospace\"><span style=\"text-wrap: wrap;\"><br></span></font></font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; text-wrap: nowrap; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; text-wrap: wrap;\">     ☞ </span><font color=\"#212529\" face=\"SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, Liberation Mono, Courier New, monospace\"><span style=\"text-wrap: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">기혼자실, 장애인실은 우선선발, 추가선발에만 지원가능합니다.</span><br></span></font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; text-wrap: nowrap; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><font color=\"#212529\" face=\"SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, Liberation Mono, Courier New, monospace\"><span style=\"text-wrap: wrap;\"><br></span></font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; text-wrap: nowrap; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; text-wrap: wrap;\">  Q. </span><font color=\"#212529\" face=\"SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, Liberation Mono, Courier New, monospace\"><span style=\"text-wrap: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">일반선발 최대 지망까지 다 선택해야 신청되는건가요?</span><br></span></font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; text-wrap: nowrap; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; text-wrap: wrap;\">     ☞ </span><font color=\"#212529\" face=\"SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, Liberation Mono, Courier New, monospace\"><span style=\"text-wrap: wrap; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">일반선발은 최대지망까지 클릭해야 신청이 가능합니다.</span></font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; text-wrap: nowrap; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Batang, 바탕, serif\"><font color=\"#212529\" face=\"SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, Liberation Mono, Courier New, monospace\"><span style=\"text-wrap: wrap; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">\n  Q. 동계방학에 거주하던 호실이 달라지나요?\n     ☞ 호실 변동 있습니다. \n\n</span></font></font><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; text-wrap: wrap;\">  Q</span><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Batang, 바탕, serif\"><font color=\"#212529\" face=\"SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, Liberation Mono, Courier New, monospace\"><span style=\"text-wrap: wrap; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">. 공고문에 나온 신청 기간 말고는 추가로 신청을 못하나요?\n     ☞ 네, 신청기간 외에는 신청할 수 없습니다.\n\n</span></font></font><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; text-wrap: wrap;\">  Q</span><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Batang, 바탕, serif\"><span style=\"text-wrap: wrap; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">. 선발결과, 납부계좌는 언제 확인할 수 있나요?\n</span></font><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; text-wrap: wrap;\">     </span><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Batang, 바탕, serif\"><span style=\"text-wrap: wrap; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">☞ 신청하신 선발의 등록기간 첫날, 선발결과 및 계봐번호를 확인할 수 있습니다.\n         예) 우선선발 선발결과 → 우선선발 등록기간인 1. 8.(목) 10시부터 </span></font><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Batang, 바탕, serif\"><span style=\"text-wrap: wrap; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">통합 정보시스템</span></font><span style=\"text-wrap: wrap; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">에서 확인 가능</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; text-wrap: nowrap; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Batang, 바탕, serif\"><font color=\"#212529\" face=\"SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, Liberation Mono, Courier New, monospace\"><span style=\"text-wrap: wrap; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">\n</span></font></font><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; text-wrap: wrap;\">  Q</span><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Batang, 바탕, serif\"><font color=\"#212529\" face=\"SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, Liberation Mono, Courier New, monospace\"><span style=\"text-wrap: wrap; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">. 우선선발, 일반선발, 추가선발 중 저는 어느 관에 신청할 수 있나요?\n     ☞ 공고문의 13페이지에서 우선, 일반선발에 신청가능 관을 확인하실 수 있습니다. </span></font></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; text-align: center;\"></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Batang, 바탕, serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">         추가선발 신청기간에는 여석이 있는 모든 관에 신청가능합니다. </span></font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Batang, 바탕, serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">         자세한 사항은 첨부파일의 공고문을 확인하시기 바랍니다. \n\n</span></font><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">  Q</span><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Batang, 바탕, serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">. 담당자 전화번호가 어떻게 되나요?\n</span></font><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">     </span><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Batang, 바탕, serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">☞ 선발 문의: 054-478-7943\n         ☞ 생활관비 문의: 푸름관비: 7201, 오름관비 7947(오름관2·3동 공공요금 예치금 포함)\n</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">         ☞ 푸름관·아름관 시설(공사, 고장 포함) 문의: 7946\n         ☞ 오름관 시설(공사, 고장 포함) 문의(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">각 관 운영사): 오름관1동(070-8786-5001), 오름관2동(070-7209-6070),</span></span></font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Batang, 바탕, serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">                                                                                     </span></font><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">오름관3동(070-7198-1650)</span></p></div><p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace; font-size: 14px; text-wrap: wrap; line-height: 1.5; word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace; font-size: 14px; padding-top: 0px; text-wrap: wrap; line-height: 1.5; word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace; font-size: 14px; padding-top: 0px; text-wrap: wrap; line-height: 1.5; word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><br></p></pre>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
